# git-annex configuration for MMA test datasets
# Read-only remote dataset repository (EOSC DataRepo):
#   https://datarepo.eosc.cz/datasets/records/39arw-t9a93
#   DOI: 10.48700/39arw-t9a93
#
# By default, keep all repository files (including non-test .h5 lookup tables)
# in regular Git; only manage .h5 and .dat files under module tests/ directories
# with git-annex.
* annex.largefiles=nothing
*/tests/**/*.h5 annex.largefiles=anything annex.backend=SHA256E
*/tests/**/*.dat annex.largefiles=anything annex.backend=SHA256E
